From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andy Phan <andyphan@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:38:16 -0700
Subject: [PDF] Do not expose PDF extension frames during script execution

When OOPIF PDF is enabled, do not expose the PDF extension frame or any
of its child frames during script execution. Previously, only child
frames of the PDF extension frame were skipped, allowing <webview>
embedders to execute scripts in the PDF extension frame.

TAG=agy
CONV=0f8d9e7b-e4c8-4b43-96fd-250f83a6073f

Bug: 497950736
